    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Nightmare Halls, a chilling first-person horror adventure where your wits\u2014and your courage\u2014will be put to the test. Trapped within the shadowy corridors of an ancient, forsaken mansion, you awaken with no memory of how you arrived. The air is thick with dread, the walls whisper secrets, and every creak of the floorboards sends your heart racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a descent into terror. To escape the mansion\u2019s sinister grip, you\u2019ll need to unravel its dark history by solving puzzles, deciphering clues, and uncovering hidden passages. But beware: the mansion is alive with horrors\u2014unseen entities, grotesque apparitions, and traps that test the limits of your sanity. Each decision you make brings you closer to freedom\u2026 or a fate worse than the shadows that lurk within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With haunting visuals, an immersive soundtrack, and a gripping narrative, Nightmare Halls will keep you on edge as you navigate its eerie chambers. Are you brave enough to face its horrors and escape\u2014or will you become another lost soul, forever trapped in its nightmare?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average play time of this game is 60 minutes.</p>",
